Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, nationwide, is Mother's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether or not you like your mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.43,0:00:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether or not your relationship with her is good...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're a Japanese citizen, you'll take this matter seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't come to this park with a solid reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only purely, randomly, aimlessly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,riding on my mountain bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Riding and riding until I reached this park.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:36.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for me to be the only one in the park even though it's a Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:39.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as if I'm the only one in the entire world, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This may be a bit of an exaggeration,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it feels as if I have the rights to the entire park.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.67,0:00:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I never need to go back home anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how I feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alone again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.40,0:01:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This comes as no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:14.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi, that's why...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my. What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought the carcass of some dog had been left here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what's this? It's Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? It was just a greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:16.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was only a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, i-it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the innocent Araragi-kun was fascinated by my charming clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and felt a moment of bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not worry about that pun.\NI am indeed fascinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:34.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know, "fascination" is a pretty amazing word, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.26,0:03:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know...?\NIt's written with a "grass" radical on top of "hot water."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In my heart,\Nit's a level above the word "moe," which is written with a "grass" radical on top of "bright."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:48.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People are expecting it to carry onto the next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:50.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Note: The Kanji read "Next World" which is a pun for "Maid"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like "maid fascination" or "cat ears fascination."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll be going and saying things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:03:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The impression that these clothes give off
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:04:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is quite different from the ones I've seen you in before, so I was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:07.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's because I chose to wear more docile clothing at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:14.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I bought this set of clothing, top and bottom, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm content.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:19.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If possible, I wanted you to see it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That you wanted to show it to me first...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I put it...?\NMaybe I'm beyond lucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to {\i1}show{\i0\fscx160} {\r}them to you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:34.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to {\i1}see{\i0\fscx140} {\r}them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.53,0:04:38.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The nuance in those statements is entirely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:46.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I was just riding around a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was riding my bike randomly,\Nand there was a park,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I decided to stop and rest a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You?\NDo you come around here often?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This area used to be my turf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your turf...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean you used to live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it has changed completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to get sentimental over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the place where I used to live changing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like it just cuts off my motivation, for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that inevitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right. It is inevitable. {Mr. Anderson.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-kun, do you mind if I sit beside you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beside me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was starting to feel bad, keeping the entire bench to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:47.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?\NThen I shall help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About what happened before...\NI wanted to thank you one more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to thank me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should thank Oshino instead. I think that's more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:10.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I have to pay Oshino-san, so it's a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for you, I wish to express my gratitude differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you are feeling grateful to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should just stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise it will be hard for us to get along from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:29.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I think of you as someone close to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.60,0:06:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That... Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you are the type who doesn't make many friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was true until last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then a paradigm shift occurred during spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.49,0:06:51.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:54.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was the same until recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.25,0:06:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More specifically, until I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does she mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what is this weird situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels as if she's about to confess to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what you say, I still wish to reward you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:16.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, we will, for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,become friends of equal status.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.53,0:07:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hence, Araragi-kun, is there anything you want me to do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will only take one request, but it can be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really, anything is acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what the wish, I will grant it. However, you are limited to only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be it "world domination," "immortality,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"defeating the Saiyans headed to Earth right now"; all is acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you possess powers that surpass those of the Eternal Dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:48.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But indeed, truthfully, I'd prefer to hear a more personal wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because it's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:58.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd assume so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:01.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really, anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For example, you might want me to put a "nyu" at the end of every sentence for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:08.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you will want me to go to class without wearing panties for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:13.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll want me to wake you up every day for a week, wearing nothing but an apron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or you might want me to join you on an enema diet for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have many different preferences, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:20.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that I'm at that level of maniac perversion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even coming from you, isn't that way too rude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... That... I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:34.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess if you said you wanted me to do that forever, I wouldn't be able to take it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Wrong. That's completely wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not angry over the fact that my level of perversion has been lowered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a reference, I personally recommend "waking you up every day for a week, wearing nothing but an apron."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:53.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can also make breakfast for you, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:57.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't viewing that from behind romantic for a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if we make that sort of arrangement, I think us just being "friends" will be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, if you put it that way, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's just say that erotic things are off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.97,0:09:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I figured that you wouldn't ever ask for anything erotic, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a great deal of trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, of course. You're a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we did talk about that, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Virgins aren't that greedy, so I'm more at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm... Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have any experience either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:37.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Of course I have experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Experience with orgies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, even if that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you get out of telling me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand. Correction:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:09:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have any experience.\NI'm a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:09:59.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:05.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means the only girls who would talk to hopeless virgins like you are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:09.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at best, late-blooming virgins with mental health issues such as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:17.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The conversation seems to have gone a bit astray...\NBut honestly, is there anything you need help with, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something that you're just troubled about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Troubled...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not a very good talker, so I can't say it very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.21,0:10:28.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but my intention of wanting to help you is sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.71,0:10:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NIf I dare to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try telling me about it.\NYou'll feel better if you just talk about it. Or so they say, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.39,0:10:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had a fight with my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:46.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like something I can't help with very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for the time being, go ahead and tell me the rest of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:52.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"For the time being"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which of your younger sisters did you have a fight with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:11:00.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have two younger sisters, after all, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You knew that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I had to pick just one, it was the elder one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:07.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, really, it was with both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:14.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of them, always, whatever they do, and wherever they are, stick firmly together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:17.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are the Tsuganoki Middle School Fire Sisters, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:19.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You even know their nicknames?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:21.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today is Mother's Day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:24.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, it is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.23,0:11:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of them are really close to our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My mother dotes on them like they're cats.\NAnd...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As the irresponsible eldest son,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:42.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,now, on this day, today, Mother's Day, you have no place at home, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's basically it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I tried to sneak out of the house early in the morning, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just as I'd gotten on my mountain bike, my sister caught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:54.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We then had a quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:55.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:12:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sister wanted me to celebrate Mother's Day together with my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, how do I put it...?\NYou know, I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:05.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi, that's why...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why no matter how much time passes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To sum it all up, a person like me who can't celebrate just one Mother's Day...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.49,0:12:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is angry with himself over what his four-years-younger sister said to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I put it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm angry with myself for being such a petty human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty complicated problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not complicated. It's just minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I'm just a really petty person," or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even so, the more I think about having to apologize to my sister, the more I don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't want to go home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.89,0:12:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to say that in regard to your pettiness, there's nothing I can do, even with my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about a little encouragement?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's rather obvious, but in regard to your pettiness, there's nothing I can do, even with my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.53,0:13:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be thinking that I'm a boring person...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Troubled over such a small thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't really...\Nstand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.71,0:13:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Small.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:18.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can also be said to be lame. The sort of lameness that comes from getting a fortune told by a fortune teller.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't deny that you're charming, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Charming?!\NCould it be that my charm has been drawing low-luck from fortune-telling all this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:29.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, your lameness isn't drawing low-luck from fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say that I'll only be able to draw terrible-luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.\NThat would be most incredible.\NOr rather, that would be quite favorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your lameness is something like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drawing a great-fortune, but when you read it specifically, it doesn't say that anything that good will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sort of lameness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That really is lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Araragi-kun, you look like the type to dote on your sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Always quarreling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they ugly sisters who'd make your eyes bleed from looking at them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:07.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't make my eyes bleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or did she betray your love?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you secretly be a siscon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.48,0:14:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Falling in love with your sister... is just a fantasy by those who don't have sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:22.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then Araragi-kun, you aren't a siscon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't fall in love with your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:26.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. You seem more like a sorocon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorocon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The short form of sororate marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:36.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also known as inter-marriage inclusive of all sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means marrying the older or younger sister of one's wife who passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I a sorocon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:47.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In your case, Araragi-kun, you will most likely marry the younger sister instead of the older one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, you'll get your wife's younger sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to call you "Big Brother," and then you'll marry her afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even after getting married, you will still let her call you "Big Brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what it originally meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I definitely killed that previous wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Araragi-kun, the sorocon...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please call me a siscon. I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.57,0:15:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that you won't fall in love with your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:12.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will also not fall in love with the sister of my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:16.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then will you fall in love with a lover that is not blood-related?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? A lover that is not blood-related?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"You sure are petty." Such a small joke is enough to leave you speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your words are not some small joke, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.43,0:15:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was testing you just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I being tested?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean you're still not going at me at full force?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:37.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To use my full potential, I'd have to transform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transform?!\NWow, I really want to see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You make such huge reactions, but you yourself are petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But regardless of how petty you are, I will never abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will cope with you and your pettiness to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your words are complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:16:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why, besides your pettiness, are there any other things you are troubled about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:04.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you plan on scolding me this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your significance has increased. Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't praise me in such a forced way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there really nothing else you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to help you with your studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:17.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have already given up on that.\NIt's fine as long as I'm able to graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.77,0:16:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then do you want me to help you with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can live normally and graduate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then do you want to be normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight with me? You are, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:39.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happens if I say I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:44.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you will have a girlfriend. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, actually I don't really want a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Buy me some juice next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:16:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? That's really unselfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:14.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That child was also here just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:21.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you read the name on the name tag of that elementary school kid's bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, a normal person shouldn't be able to see it at such a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:31.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm, the numbers "eight," "nine," and "shrine."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The "eight" and "nine" plus "shrine" write out to be "eight nine tera."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's pronounced "Hachikuji."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji?\NSo her name's Hachikuji Mayoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't look like the type that likes small kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you wait here for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:54.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, but where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go talk to the elementary school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't. You'll only get a scar on your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:04.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can she say these spiteful things so nonchalantly...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:17.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't speak to me. I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:22.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt. That's all that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:30.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:32.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell with your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lost, aren't you?\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at that memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:55.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:58.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was ignored by an elementary school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time definitely... I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really know what you want to do or what you're doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you finally turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone would turn around after such a beating from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:26.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it looked like you were having some difficulties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I was wondering if I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The kind of help a person who would suddenly attack an elementary school kid's head could offer...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,doesn't exist in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.97,0:19:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, my name is Araragi Koyomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:46.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi?\NIt sure sounds like a girl's name, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.19,0:19:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girly, don't come near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:57.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Hachikuji Mayoi.\NI'm called Hachikuji Mayoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:20:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an important name given to me by my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, stop talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?\NI won't harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:15.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't a more harmless person than me in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:19.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well, then. I'll be less alert with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That will make things easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.55,0:20:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, beastly man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beastly man?!\NWho are you calling that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's yelling at me! I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for yelling at you, but "beastly man" is going just a little too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone would have yelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, how should I address you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, a normal way of addressing me is good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is Araragi-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, normal is good. Normal is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.91,0:20:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate you, Araragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:54.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. As I was saying, you're lost, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.29,0:20:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A minuscule problem like this is hardly a problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:20:59.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am not.\NYou are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.14,0:21:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:12.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:28.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think that an elementary school student could beat a high school student?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:35.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a figure of a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:37.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who fought an elementary school kid, threw her over his back with all his might,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:41.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and was boasting about his victory from the bottom of his heart, despite the fact that he was in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:55.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:22:01.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just brush aside things of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.57,0:22:03.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She seems to have lost her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that I could help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.95,0:22:10.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:15.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I see.\NI understand the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.92,0:22:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.09,0:22:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you heard the address of this area, you'd roughly know where it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.22,0:22:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well yes, to a certain extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.39,0:22:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give this girl a look at that memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that I had a dream of being abused by an evil high school boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having that happen in real life sounds impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NImpossible, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.87,0:22:49.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like touching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.58,0:22:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only touching the memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:59.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also don't wish to touch the things you've touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:04.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.\NI will read it. Is that fine with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.59,0:23:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:08.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know where this place is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.55,0:23:10.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.85,0:23:11.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:15.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know the exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:18.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we should be able to find it based on our senses when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.86,0:23:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.15,0:23:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said, we are going to the location written on the memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.24,0:23:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl knows the way. She will lead you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, she'll lead the way...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.16,0:23:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you not lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:41.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the lost child of a snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.63,0:23:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.82,0:25:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.\NI'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.15,0:25:28.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even the kids of the kings are considered kings, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.69,0:25:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've gotten that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.61,0:25:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reading kings seem kind of fake, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the thing earlier seemed more like reading to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.32,0:25:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:36.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of corruption, they apparently become like kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.53,0:25:39.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But every once in a while, aren't the kings a bit stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So nowadays reader kings are kind of in a heartbreaking state, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A heartbreaking state, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.12,0:25:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quiz time.\NIt's that time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.88,0:25:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tsukihi-chan and I are twins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're not twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which of the 12 constellations is known as the twin constellation?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Gemini?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, actually, Pisces is also a twin constellation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.63,0:25:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.55,0:25:52.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, Mayoi Snail Part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.59,0:25:55.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it may not necessarily be a twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.05,0:25:57.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It could be like us.
